<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets call warrants on Taiwan Weighted Index.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on Taiwan Weighted Index.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Friday it intended to issue 20 million American-style composite call warrants on the Taiwan Weighted Index.</p>
<p>One warrant equivalent to US$0.1 per index point.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	  US$212.79    PREMIUM	 11.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	   US$5.04	GEARING	 4.69X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	    19.SEPT.97   SETTLEMENT    TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p> LISTING		 LUXEMBOURG   MIN EXER LOT  1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE	US$236.43</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
